{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2026/0602/c79319a3169103/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:28.989550+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2026/0602/c79319a3169103/page.htm","html":"<div><p><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2026/0602/c79319a3169103/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>浙江大学生命科学学院源于<span>1929</span>年成立的浙江大学生物系，是我国高校中最早建立的生物系之一，建系<span>90</span>余年</span></span></a><span><span><span>来，曾涌现出贝时璋、谈家桢、罗宗洛、朱壬葆、姚錱、施履吉、施教耐等<span>19</span>位院士为代表的一批杰出的生物学家。<span><br/><span>    </span></span>为搭建全国优秀大学生交流学习平台，开拓学术视野、激发科研热情以及展示宣传学院办学成果，<span>2026</span>年生命科学学院将继续举办全国优秀大学生夏令营活动。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span><span><strong><span>一、申请条件</span></strong></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>全国高校生物学、生态学、农学、基础医学、药学、理学和地学等相关专业的<span>2027</span>届优秀本科毕业生。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学习成绩优秀，本科前<span>2.5</span>年的总评成绩排名在专业班级前<span>10%</span>。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>外语要求：英语水平优良。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强研究潜力。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>二、申请时间及申请材料递交方式</span></strong></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>报名时间：即日起至<span>2026</span>年<span>6</span>月<span>22</span>日截止。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>申请者须登录浙江大学研究生院招生网<span>2026</span>年浙江大学夏令营网报入口进行网上报名。</span></span></span><span><span><span>请准确填写本人手机号，并用此手机号注册安装钉钉<span>App</span>，</span></span></span><span><span><span>方便后期统一加入夏令营活动的钉钉群。<strong><span>报名入口</span></strong>：</span></span></span><a href=\"https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span></span></span></a><span><span><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>以下<span>1-6</span>申请材料的扫描件按顺序制作成一个<span>PDF</span>（从报名系统上传）：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>《<img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/a8593ee6d6e14ec8bd28.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/6e/6a/146a802442b9915459cb31edb76a/1475d6de-b8fb-4cf7-a2c7-d2038824c353.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生命科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动申请表.docx</a>》；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>身份证正反扫描件；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人简历；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科成绩单及总成绩排名（须加盖院系或学校教务处公章）；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>英语六级或<span>GRE</span>或托福或雅思等外语成绩证书扫描件；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>6.3000</span></span></span><span><span><span>字以内关于个人学习、学术研究经历及未来规划的陈述；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>其他获奖证明材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>三、夏令营活动安排</span></strong></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>夏令营拟招收营员<span>130</span>名左右。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月下旬，经学院各学科审核后公布夏令营营员名单。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.6</span></span></span><span><span><span>月下旬，夏令营营员登录浙江大学研究生院招生网确认是否按照要求参加夏令营。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.7</span></span></span><span><span><span>月上旬，夏令营活动。</span></span></span><span></span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><strong><span>日期</span></strong></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><strong><span>内容</span></strong></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2026/0602/c79319a3169103/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>7</span></a></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>日<span>-10</span>日</span></span><br/></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>营员报到（7月8日报到）</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>开营仪式、分模块学术活动、校园文化交流、实验室参观等</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span><strong><span>四、其他说明</span></strong></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>入营营员名单以官网公布为准，未入选者不再另行通知；入选者如放弃参加夏令营，请第一时间告知主办方，以便学院调整。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>参加暑期夏令营的学生在夏令营期间应遵守浙江大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加活动。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>申请者可到浙江大学生命科学学院官网主页获取更多学科及导师的信息。<a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2026/0602/c79319a3169103/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/2026/0602/c79319a3169103/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/clscn/26360/list.htm</span></span></a><span><span>  </span></span></span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>浙江大学生命科学学院通讯地址：浙江省杭州市余杭塘路<span>866</span>号，浙大紫金港校区生命科学大楼，电话：<span>0571-88206488</span>，邮箱：<span>sinohui84@zju.edu.cn</span>。</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span> </span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>浙江大学生命科学学院</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span>年<span>6</span>月</span></span></span><span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"adbbee075056d5075d1efdebf3dada955099d7636a10ac225e94262c4da6307e","textLength":1101,"sourceSha256":"dda61230fa627b49ec63a320ba145d1744342e98929e65e6636daaaffbfd945a","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-73f817255630afa0c268","title":"2026年浙江大学生命科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营活动报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:28.989550+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cls.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/a8593ee6d6e14ec8bd28.gif"}]}
